{"server":"en","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-07_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-07","title":"It Fell From the Sky!","storyCode":"6-8","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"9d60a39bd0b7321f5a8cca8f111781636f0560a0e1c173d069acf07b0f107a26","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"*Pant* *pant*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Blaze!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm fine! They... have some moves."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"You're not freezing, are you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Thanks to you, we're okay. You're keeping the air warm enough to stop her chills."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't mention it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey Frosty, why aren't you using lethal Arts?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*Hack* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"So that's why."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...FrostNova, she..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"FrostNova's the name?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*Hack*... Help me... cover..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Sister..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Get out of here, Amiya. There could be more Reunion on the way. Do we have any injured? I can help."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"So you're retreating?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm going to politely suggest that you don't fight anymore, snow bunny."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"If you keep using your Arts like that, you're going to die. You're just burning your life into power."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Or, you could always come to Rhodes Island. We've got ways to extend your life."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't look at me like that... I don't need your pity."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Do I look like I pity you? You're strong. I respect you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Why are you running away?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*Cough*... *Hack* *hack*..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}, run. Don't look at her!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion forces closing on our position!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"You're not leaving."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Sister, don't use that now, not where you're standing!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't let them escape!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Who knows what Rhodes Island might do to our people in Lungmen!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"The temperature difference... it's causing the structure... to weaken!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*Cough* *cough*... freeze!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......♪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*Hack*...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"It's working..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"The Originium we buried has changed the structure of the lower levels, the plates are tilting!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Sister, it's too dangerous! Hold onto me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Sister?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...Blaze. Do you hear that?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Is that the sound of the structure shattering?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Buried Originium... heat absorption... temperature difference..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's collapsing... FrostNova's Arts can actually do that...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"No!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"The plate is warping!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion is capable of something like this?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"All I know is... the whole district is sinking!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Run! Get to a stable area! The ground here is caving in!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...Doctor?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, the ground under you... it's... splitting?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Uh oh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. {@nickname}, move!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Move what...?","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, stay where you are! Dr. {@nickname}, grab onto that lamppost!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Save the Doctor!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"The ground is splitting too fast! I can't reach!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Then I'll do it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"No!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What did——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"...I'm okay.","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"The buildings can't support their own weight anymore, they're all collapsing!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite, take her!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay, I've got Amiya!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Put me down!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, go. I'll get the Doctor! I'm an elite operator, I can do it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Welp, looks like we're not quite done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, I'm going to use airflow and pressure to slow your fall and push away the building beside you. Don't worry, it won't crush you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Just don't panic! I've got you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"...See you soon!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"See you.","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Sup? Where's FrostNova?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Your commander fell down there too, huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"...Yes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Could we not fight?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Rabbit of Rhodes Island, could we forge a temporary armistice? Honestly, we never much wanted to fight you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Mephisto told our sister you'd killed Alex, and she was very concerned about what you would do next."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Who's Alex?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm sorry. I did kill Skullshatterer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"...Oh."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Infected really should not fight one another. I'm sorry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"What's to apologize for? It was a battle, wasn't it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It was."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"So let's have a ceasefire. Nesti, what do you say?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? *Ursine profanity*!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Nesti says he's fine with it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't think that's what he said."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"As long as we're not in battle, there's no reason to kill anyone, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why is it... you want a ceasefire?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Did you ever notice that both our sides are led by rabbits?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I think something in my brain just broke."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"These are the yetis of the ice field?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Wh- what do you mean?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Shouldn't they be cold, merciless killers?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"This isn't right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"That's prejudiced."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Listen here, bunny."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Who wins the battle, or where you go, none of that matters to us. All we care about is our sister's life."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"And you're worried about your friend too, right?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Right. We didn't come here to hurt anyone."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"You're definitely not here to hunt Reunion for sport, are you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course not!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"You know... it's funny..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"If it weren't for Patriot insisting on unity in the Reunion Movement, we'd have dealt with Mephisto and his people a long time ago."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"And that'd be kinda like hunting Reunion for sport, huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Yeti Squad Member","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's get digging, shall we?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["Blaze"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["FrostNova"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["Frostleaf"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["Meteorite"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["Jessica"]}]}
